  "hasSol": true,
  "task_html": "<div class='task-block' style='background:#7c3aed18;border:1.5px solid #7c3aed40;'><div class='task-block-label' style='color:#7c3aed;'>Die Umkehrfunktion</div><div style='background:#ede9fe;border:1.5px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;'>Die <strong>Umkehrfunktion f&#x207B;&#xB9;</strong> macht r&uuml;ckg&auml;ngig, was f tut: Wenn f(3) = 10, dann f&#x207B;&#xB9;(10) = 3.<br><strong>Herleitung:</strong> Starte mit y = f(x) &rarr; l&ouml;se nach x auf &rarr; tausche x und y.</div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:4px 0 14px;'><svg viewBox='0 0 200 210' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-height:210px;'><rect x='0' y='0' width='200' height='210' rx='12' fill='#f5f3ff'/><line x1='20' y1='8' x2='20' y2='202' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='50' y1='8' x2='50' y2='202' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='110' y1='8' x2='110' y2='202' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='140' y1='8' x2='140' y2='202' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='170' y1='8' x2='170' y2='202' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='175' x2='192' y2='175' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='145' x2='192' y2='145' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='85' x2='192' y2='85' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='55' x2='192' y2='55' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='25' x2='192' y2='25' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='6' y1='115' x2='194' y2='115' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='80' y1='6' x2='80' y2='204' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='1.3'/><text x='20' y='127' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-4</text><text x='50' y='127' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-2</text><text x='110' y='127' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>2</text><text x='140' y='127' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>4</text><text x='170' y='127' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>6</text><text x='73' y='178' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-4</text><text x='73' y='148' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-2</text><text x='73' y='88' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>2</text><text x='73' y='58' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>4</text><text x='73' y='28' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>6</text><line x1='8' y1='188' x2='188' y2='8' stroke='#9ca3af' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='6,4'/><line x1='65' y1='205' x2='167' y2='1' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='140' cy='55' r='4.5' fill='#dc2626' stroke='white' stroke-width='2'/><text x='145' y='51' font-size='9' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>(4|4)</text><text x='168' y='4' font-size='11' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700'>f</text><text x='188' y='11' font-size='9' fill='#9ca3af'>y=x</text><text x='90' y='60' font-size='12' fill='#ea580c' font-weight='700'>f&#x207B;&#xB9; = ?</text></svg></div><div style='display:grid;gap:8px;'><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;'><span style='font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;'>a)</span> Gegeben: <strong>f(x) = 2x &minus; 4</strong>. Leite f&#x207B;&#xB9;(x) her.</div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;'><span style='font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;'>b)</span> Berechne f(f&#x207B;&#xB9;(x)) und f&#x207B;&#xB9;(f(x)). Was f&auml;llt auf?</div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;'><span style='font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;'>c)</span> Zeichne f und f&#x207B;&#xB9; in ein Koordinatensystem. Erg&auml;nze die Spiegelachse y = x. Welche Symmetrie siehst du?</div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;'><span style='font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;'>d) Bonus:</span> Berechne den Schnittpunkt von f und f&#x207B;&#xB9;. Wo liegt er im Verh&auml;ltnis zu y = x?</div></div></div>",
  "sol_html": "<div style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;'><div style='background:#ede9fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:2.4;'><strong style='font-family:sans-serif;'>a) Herleitung:</strong><br>y = 2x &minus; 4 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; | +4<br>y + 4 = 2x &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; | &divide;2<br>x = 0,5y + 2<br>&rarr; x &harr; y: &nbsp;<strong>f&#x207B;&#xB9;(x) = 0,5x + 2</strong></div><div style='background:#ede9fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:2.4;'><strong style='font-family:sans-serif;'>b) Komposition:</strong><br>f(f&#x207B;&#xB9;(x)) = 2&middot;(0,5x+2) &minus; 4 = x + 4 &minus; 4 = <strong>x</strong> &#x2714;<br>f&#x207B;&#xB9;(f(x)) = 0,5&middot;(2x&minus;4) + 2 = x &minus; 2 + 2 = <strong>x</strong> &#x2714;<br><span style='font-family:sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#6d28d9;'>Beide ergeben x &ndash; f&#x207B;&#xB9; macht f r&uuml;ckg&auml;ngig!</span></div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:4px 0 12px;'><svg viewBox='0 0 200 210' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-height:210px;'><rect x='0' y='0' width='200' height='210' rx='12' fill='#f5f3ff'/><line x1='20' y1='8' x2='20' y2='202' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='50' y1='8' x2='50' y2='202' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='110' y1='8' x2='110' y2='202' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='140' y1='8' x2='140' y2='202' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='170' y1='8' x2='170' y2='202' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='175' x2='192' y2='175' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='145' x2='192' y2='145' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='85' x2='192' y2='85' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='55' x2='192' y2='55' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='25' x2='192' y2='25' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='6' y1='115' x2='194' y2='115' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='80' y1='6' x2='80' y2='204' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='1.3'/><text x='20' y='127' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-4</text><text x='50' y='127' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-2</text><text x='110' y='127' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>2</text><text x='140' y='127' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>4</text><text x='170' y='127' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>6</text><text x='73' y='178' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-4</text><text x='73' y='148' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-2</text><text x='73' y='88' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>2</text><text x='73' y='58' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>4</text><text x='73' y='28' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>6</text><line x1='8' y1='188' x2='188' y2='8' stroke='#9ca3af' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='6,4'/><line x1='65' y1='205' x2='167' y2='1' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='20' y1='115' x2='192' y2='26' stroke='#ea580c' stroke-width='2.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='80' y1='175' x2='20' y2='115' stroke='#6d28d9' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='3,3'/><line x1='110' y1='115' x2='80' y2='85' stroke='#6d28d9' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='3,3'/><circle cx='140' cy='55' r='4.5' fill='#dc2626' stroke='white' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='80' cy='175' r='3.5' fill='#2563eb' stroke='white' stroke-width='1.5'/><circle cx='20' cy='115' r='3.5' fill='#ea580c' stroke='white' stroke-width='1.5'/><circle cx='110' cy='115' r='3.5' fill='#2563eb' stroke='white' stroke-width='1.5'/><circle cx='80' cy='85' r='3.5' fill='#ea580c' stroke='white' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='145' y='52' font-size='10' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>S(4|4)</text><text x='168' y='4' font-size='11' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700'>f</text><text x='188' y='28' font-size='11' fill='#ea580c' font-weight='700'>f&#x207B;&#xB9;</text><text x='188' y='11' font-size='9' fill='#9ca3af'>y=x</text></svg></div><div style='background:#ede9fe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;'><strong>c)</strong> f und f&#x207B;&#xB9; sind Spiegelbilder an der Geraden <strong>y = x</strong>. Jeder Punkt (a|b) auf f entspricht dem Punkt (b|a) auf f&#x207B;&#xB9;. Die gestrichelten Linien im Bild zeigen je ein Spiegelpaar.<br><strong>d)</strong> 2x &minus; 4 = 0,5x + 2 &rarr; 1,5x = 6 &rarr; x = 4, y = 4 &rarr; <strong>S(4|4)</strong> &ndash; liegt exakt auf y = x &#x2714;</div></div>"
